<title>POLAND: Polish Bauma to start bourse trade May 21.</title>
<headline>Polish Bauma to start bourse trade May 21.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction materials maker Bauma SA will start bourse trade on the parallel market on May 21, the bourse's president Wieslaw Rozlucki told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bauma's January 1.2-million-share initial public offering priced at 10 zlotys per share was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
